</section>

<!-- SECTION 2: TEMPORAL TRENDS -->
<section id="temporal-trends">
  <h2>2. Temporal Price Trends & Volatility</h2>
  <p>This section analyzes weekly and yearly price trends for each fuel type, identifies periods of peak volatility, and quantifies the correlation between Brent Crude movements and retail price changes.</p>

  <h3>Brent Crude vs. Retail Price Time Series (Bi-Weekly, 2020-2026)</h3>
  <div class="chart-container">
    <canvas id="chart-temporal-series"></canvas>
